@ClerkAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5014

# Grab a session token from the browser devtools (the __session cookie) or
# `await getToken()` in the Next.js app, then paste it here.
@ClerkToken = <paste a Clerk session token>

### Liveness probe — no auth required
GET {{ClerkAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Secured sample endpoint
GET {{ClerkAPI_HostAddress}}/api/WeatherForecast
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ClerkToken}}

### The Clerk profile behind the token
GET {{ClerkAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Users/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ClerkToken}}

###
